# Semua file teks memakai LF di repo dan di working tree, apa pun `core.autocrlf` di mesin masing-masing.
# Prettier (`endOfLine: "lf"`) dan .editorconfig memakai LF juga, jadi format:check tidak gagal karena CRLF di Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Biner: jangan diubah.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
